     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="Table22.A1" office:value-type="string">
      <text:p text:style-name="Table_20_Contents">Ligne : mémoire insuffisante (affiché « No memory » dans le pad de la ligne).</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
    </table:table-row>
    <table:table-row>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="Table22.A1" office:value-type="string">
      <text:p text:style-name="Table_20_Contents">2701</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="Table22.A1" office:value-type="string">
      <text:p text:style-name="Table_20_Contents">Interstys</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="Table22.A1" office:value-type="string">
      <text:p text:style-name="Table_20_Contents">Effet : nombre de canaux incorrect.</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
    </table:table-row>
    <table:table-row>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="Table22.A1" office:value-type="string">
      <text:p text:style-name="Table_20_Contents">2702</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="Table22.A1" office:value-type="string">
      <text:p text:style-name="Table_20_Contents">Interstys</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="Table22.A1" office:value-type="string">
      <text:p text:style-name="Table_20_Contents">Effet : sortie incorrecte (câble propre, Out ou bus).</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
    </table:table-row>
    <table:table-row>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="Table22.A1" office:value-type="string">
      <text:p text:style-name="Table_20_Contents">2703</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="Table22.A1" office:value-type="string">
      <text:p text:style-name="Table_20_Contents">Interstys</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="Table22.A1" office:value-type="string">
      <text:p text:style-name="Table_20_Contents">Effet : source incorrecte.</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
    </table:table-row>
    <table:table-row>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="Table22.A1" office:value-type="string">
      <text:p text:style-name="Table_20_Contents">2704</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="Table22.A1" office:value-type="string">
      <text:p text:style-name="Table_20_Contents">Interstys</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="Table22.A1" office:value-type="string">
      <text:p text:style-name="Table_20_Contents">Effet : une source recouvre la sortie.</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
    </table:table-row>
    <table:table-row>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="Table22.A1" office:value-type="string">
      <text:p text:style-name="Table_20_Contents">2705</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="Table22.A1" office:value-type="string">
      <text:p text:style-name="Table_20_Contents">Interstys</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="Table22.A1" office:value-type="string">
      <text:p text:style-name="Table_20_Contents">Effet : pas de source (le déclencheur d’un Random, les entrées A et B d’un Math ou d’un Ring sont facultatifs).</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
    </table:table-row>
    <table:table-row>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="Table22.A1" office:value-type="string">
      <text:p text:style-name="Table_20_Contents">2706</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="Table22.A1" office:value-type="string">
      <text:p text:style-name="Table_20_Contents">Interstys</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="Table22.A1" office:value-type="string">
      <text:p text:style-name="Table_20_Contents">Effet : type pas (encore) exécuté.</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
    </table:table-row>
    <table:table-row>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="Table22.A1" office:value-type="string">
      <text:p text:style-name="Table_20_Contents">2716</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="Table22.A1" office:value-type="string">
      <text:p text:style-name="Table_20_Contents">Interstys</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="Table22.A1" office:value-type="string">
      <text:p text:style-name="Table_20_Contents">Les paramètres d’Interstys dépassent sa plage de numéros.</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
    </table:table-row>
    <table:table-row>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="Table22.A1" office:value-type="string">
      <text:p text:style-name="Table_20_Contents">2717</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="Table22.A1" office:value-type="string">
      <text:p text:style-name="Table_20_Contents">Interstys</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="Table22.A1" office:value-type="string">
      <text:p text:style-name="Table_20_Contents">Les clés des effets dépassent la taille des tableaux d’un bloc (erreur interne).</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
    </table:table-row>
    <table:table-row>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="Table22.A1" office:value-type="string">
      <text:p text:style-name="Table_20_Contents">2718</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="Table22.A1" office:value-type="string">
      <text:p text:style-name="Table_20_Contents">Interstys</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="Table22.A1" office:value-type="string">
      <text:p text:style-name="Table_20_Contents">Table : trop de clés.</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
    </table:table-row>
    <table:table-row>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="Table22.A1" office:value-type="string">
      <text:p text:style-name="Table_20_Contents">2720</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="Table22.A1" office:value-type="string">
      <text:p text:style-name="Table_20_Contents">Interstys</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="Table22.A1" office:value-type="string">
      <text:p text:style-name="Table_20_Contents">Export : texte trop long : rien n’est écrit.</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
    </table:table-row>
    <table:table-row>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="Table22.A1" office:value-type="string">
      <text:p text:style-name="Table_20_Contents">2721</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="Table22.A1" office:value-type="string">
      <text:p text:style-name="Table_20_Contents">Interstys</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="Table22.A1" office:value-type="string">
      <text:p text:style-name="Table_20_Contents">Export : pas de nom.</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
    </table:table-row>
    <table:table-row>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="Table22.A1" office:value-type="string">
      <text:p text:style-name="Table_20_Contents">2722</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="Table22.A1" office:value-type="string">
      <text:p text:style-name="Table_20_Contents">Interstys</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="Table22.A1" office:value-type="string">
      <text:p text:style-name="Table_20_Contents">Export : le script auxiliaire n’est pas lancé (ou il faut le relancer).</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
    </table:table-row>
    <text:soft-page-break/>
    <table:table-row>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="Table22.A1" office:value-type="string">
      <text:p text:style-name="Table_20_Contents">2723</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="Table22.A1" office:value-type="string">
      <text:p text:style-name="Table_20_Contents">Interstys</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="Table22.A1" office:value-type="string">
      <text:p text:style-name="Table_20_Contents">Export : cet élément n’existe pas.</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
    </table:table-row>
    <table:table-row>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="Table22.A1" office:value-type="string">
      <text:p text:style-name="Table_20_Contents">2724</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="Table22.A1" office:value-type="string">
      <text:p text:style-name="Table_20_Contents">Interstys</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="Table22.A1" office:value-type="string">
      <text:p text:style-name="Table_20_Contents">Export : le fichier ne peut pas être écrit.</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
    </table:table-row>
    <table:table-row>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="Table22.A1" office:value-type="string">
      <text:p text:style-name="Table_20_Contents">2725</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="Table22.A1" office:value-type="string">
      <text:p text:style-name="Table_20_Contents">Interstys</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="Table22.A1" office:value-type="string">
      <text:p text:style-name="Table_20_Contents">Table : « Control n value v » : la valeur est attendue.</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
    </table:table-row>
    <table:table-row>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="Table22.A1" office:value-type="string">
      <text:p text:style-name="Table_20_Contents">2726</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="Table22.A1" office:value-type="string">
      <text:p text:style-name="Table_20_Contents">Interstys</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="Table22.A1" office:value-type="string">
      <text:p text:style-name="Table_20_Contents">Table : « Export » : « Patch » ou « Session » attendu.</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
    </table:table-row>
    <table:table-row>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="Table22.A1" office:value-type="string">
      <text:p text:style-name="Table_20_Contents">2727</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="Table22.A1" office:value-type="string">
      <text:p text:style-name="Table_20_Contents">Interstys</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="Table22.A1" office:value-type="string">
      <text:p text:style-name="Table_20_Contents">Table : « Tab » : un nom est attendu.</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
    </table:table-row>
    <table:table-row>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="Table22.A1" office:value-type="string">
      <text:p text:style-name="Table_20_Contents">2728</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="Table22.A1" office:value-type="string">
      <text:p text:style-name="Table_20_Contents">Interstys</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="Table22.A1" office:value-type="string">
      <text:p text:style-name="Table_20_Contents">Table : « Dump View » : ce module n’a pas de vue.</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
    </table:table-row>
    <table:table-row>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="Table22.A1" office:value-type="string">
      <text:p text:style-name="Table_20_Contents">2730</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="Table22.A1" office:value-type="string">
      <text:p text:style-name="Table_20_Contents">Interstys</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="Table22.A1" office:value-type="string">
      <text:p text:style-name="Table_20_Contents">Lien MIDI : cible attendue (Ctl, Reader, Writer, Effect ou LEDs).</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
    </table:table-row>
    <table:table-row>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="Table22.A1" office:value-type="string">
      <text:p text:style-name="Table_20_Contents">2731</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="Table22.A1" office:value-type="string">
      <text:p text:style-name="Table_20_Contents">Interstys</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="Table22.A1" office:value-type="string">
      <text:p text:style-name="Table_20_Contents">Lien MIDI : « min » ou « max » avant la cible.</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
    </table:table-row>
    <table:table-row>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="Table22.A1" office:value-type="string">
      <text:p text:style-name="Table_20_Contents">2732</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="Table22.A1" office:value-type="string">
      <text:p text:style-name="Table_20_Contents">Interstys</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="Table22.A1" office:value-type="string">
      <text:p text:style-name="Table_20_Contents">Lien MIDI : « cc m » ou « note m », ou la cible, attendu.</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
    </table:table-row>
    <table:table-row>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="Table22.A1" office:value-type="string">
      <text:p text:style-name="Table_20_Contents">2733</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="Table22.A1" office:value-type="string">
      <text:p text:style-name="Table_20_Contents">Interstys</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="Table22.A1" office:value-type="string">
      <text:p text:style-name="Table_20_Contents">Lien MIDI : « min » et « max » attendus (valeurs de la clé pour 0 et pour 127).</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
    </table:table-row>
    <table:table-row>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="Table22.A1" office:value-type="string">
      <text:p text:style-name="Table_20_Contents">2734</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="Table22.A1" office:value-type="string">
      <text:p text:style-name="Table_20_Contents">Interstys</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="Table22.A1" office:value-type="string">
      <text:p text:style-name="Table_20_Contents">Lien MIDI : cette clé ne peut pas être liée (ce n’est pas un nombre).</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
    </table:table-row>
    <table:table-row>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="Table22.A1" office:value-type="string">
      <text:p text:style-name="Table_20_Contents">2735</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="Table22.A1" office:value-type="string">
      <text:p text:style-name="Table_20_Contents">Interstys</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="Table22.A1" office:value-type="string">
      <text:p text:style-name="Table_20_Contents">Lien MIDI : l’élément visé n’existe pas.</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
    </table:table-row>
    <table:table-row>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="Table22.A1" office:value-type="string">
      <text:p text:style-name="Table_20_Contents">2736</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="Table22.A1" office:value-type="string">
      <text:p text:style-name="Table_20_Contents">Interstys</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="Table22.A1" office:value-type="string">
      <text:p text:style-name="Table_20_Contents">Lien MIDI : cette clé n’a pas de sens pour ce type d’effet.</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
    </table:table-row>
    <table:table-row>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="Table22.A1" office:value-type="string">
      <text:p text:style-name="Table_20_Contents">2737</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="Table22.A1" office:value-type="string">
      <text:p text:style-name="Table_20_Contents">Interstys</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="Table22.A1" office:value-type="string">
      <text:p text:style-name="Table_20_Contents">Lien MIDI : loi « Exp » : « min » et « max » doivent être de même signe et non nuls.</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
    </table:table-row>
    <table:table-row>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="Table22.A1" office:value-type="string">
      <text:p text:style-name="Table_20_Contents">2738</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="Table22.A1" office:value-type="string">
      <text:p text:style-name="Table_20_Contents">Interstys</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="Table22.A1" office:value-type="string">
      <text:p text:style-name="Table_20_Contents">« Dump Link » : pas de lien.</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
    </table:table-row>
    <table:table-row>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="Table22.A1" office:value-type="string">
      <text:p text:style-name="Table_20_Contents">2739</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="Table22.A1" office:value-type="string">
      <text:p text:style-name="Table_20_Contents">Interstys</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="Table22.A1" office:value-type="string">
      <text:p text:style-name="Table_20_Contents">« Inject » : « cc » ou « note » attendu.</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
    </table:table-row>
    <table:table-row>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="Table22.A1" office:value-type="string">
      <text:p text:style-name="Table_20_Contents">2740</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="Table22.A1" office:value-type="string">
      <text:p text:style-name="Table_20_Contents">Interstys</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="Table22.A1" office:value-type="string">
      <text:p text:style-name="Table_20_Contents">Lien MIDI : la cible est une action : pas de « min » ni de « max ».</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
    </table:table-row>
    <table:table-row>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="Table22.A1" office:value-type="string">
      <text:p text:style-name="Table_20_Contents">2741</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="Table22.A1" office:value-type="string">
      <text:p text:style-name="Table_20_Contents">Interstys</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="Table22.A1" office:value-type="string">
      <text:p text:style-name="Table_20_Contents">Lien MIDI : options incompatibles (pickup, pas, courbe, vitesse) pour ce mode.</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
    </table:table-row>
    <table:table-row>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="Table22.A1" office:value-type="string">
      <text:p text:style-name="Table_20_Contents">2742</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="Table22.A1" office:value-type="string">
      <text:p text:style-name="Table_20_Contents">Interstys</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="Table22.A1" office:value-type="string">
      <text:p text:style-name="Table_20_Contents">Lien MIDI : « rate » n’est possible que pour un cc (bouton, fader), pas pour une note.</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
    </table:table-row>
    <table:table-row>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="Table22.A1" office:value-type="string">
      <text:p text:style-name="Table_20_Contents">2750</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="Table22.A1" office:value-type="string">
      <text:p text:style-name="Table_20_Contents">Interstys</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="Table22.A1" office:value-type="string">
      <text:p text:style-name="Table_20_Contents">Table : un nom de bloc est attendu (Line, Writer, Reader, Effect, Global, Control, Curve, Algorithm, Instance, Set, Dump, Check, Free, Display, Remove, Clear, Export, Tab…).</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
    </table:table-row>
    <table:table-row>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="Table22.A1" office:value-type="string">
      <text:p text:style-name="Table_20_Contents">2751</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="Table22.A1" office:value-type="string">
      <text:p text:style-name="Table_20_Contents">Interstys</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="Table22.A1" office:value-type="string">
      <text:p text:style-name="Table_20_Contents">Table : « Line », « Writer », « Reader » ou « Effect » attendu.</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
    </table:table-row>
    <table:table-row>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="Table22.A1" office:value-type="string">
      <text:p text:style-name="Table_20_Contents">2752</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="Table22.A1" office:value-type="string">
      <text:p text:style-name="Table_20_Contents">Interstys</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="Table22.A1" office:value-type="string">
      <text:p text:style-name="Table_20_Contents">Table : identificateur incorrect (un numéro ou un nom).</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
    </table:table-row>
    <table:table-row>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="Table22.A1" office:value-type="string">
      <text:p text:style-name="Table_20_Contents">2753</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="Table22.A1" office:value-type="string">
      <text:p text:style-name="Table_20_Contents">Interstys</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="Table22.A1" office:value-type="string">
      <text:p text:style-name="Table_20_Contents">Table : clé inconnue.</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
    </table:table-row>
    <table:table-row>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="Table22.A1" office:value-type="string">
      <text:p text:style-name="Table_20_Contents">2754</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="Table22.A1" office:value-type="string">
      <text:p text:style-name="Table_20_Contents">Interstys</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="Table22.A1" office:value-type="string">
      <text:p text:style-name="Table_20_Contents">Table : « Check Global » : une action ne peut pas être vérifiée.</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
    </table:table-row>
    <table:table-row>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="Table22.A1" office:value-type="string">
      <text:p text:style-name="Table_20_Contents">2755</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="Table22.A1" office:value-type="string">
      <text:p text:style-name="Table_20_Contents">Interstys</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="Table22.A1" office:value-type="string">
      <text:p text:style-name="Table_20_Contents">Table : plus d’élément libre de ce type.</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
    </table:table-row>
    <table:table-row>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="Table22.A1" office:value-type="string">
      <text:p text:style-name="Table_20_Contents">2756</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="Table22.A1" office:value-type="string">
      <text:p text:style-name="Table_20_Contents">Interstys</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="Table22.A1" office:value-type="string">
      <text:p text:style-name="Table_20_Contents">Table : ce nom ne désigne pas un élément de ce type.</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
    </table:table-row>
    <table:table-row>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="Table22.A1" office:value-type="string">
      <text:p text:style-name="Table_20_Contents">2757</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="Table22.A1" office:value-type="string">
      <text:p text:style-name="Table_20_Contents">Interstys</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="Table22.A1" office:value-type="string">
      <text:p text:style-name="Table_20_Contents">Table : nom déjà utilisé par un autre élément.</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
    </table:table-row>
    <table:table-row>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="Table22.A1" office:value-type="string">
      <text:p text:style-name="Table_20_Contents">2758</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="Table22.A1" office:value-type="string">
      <text:p text:style-name="Table_20_Contents">Interstys</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="Table22.A1" office:value-type="string">
      <text:p text:style-name="Table_20_Contents">Table : « Line » : canaux du lecteur incompatibles avec la ligne.</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
    </table:table-row>
    <table:table-row>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="Table22.A1" office:value-type="string">
      <text:p text:style-name="Table_20_Contents">2759</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="Table22.A1" office:value-type="string">
      <text:p text:style-name="Table_20_Contents">Interstys</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="Table22.A1" office:value-type="string">
      <text:p text:style-name="Table_20_Contents">Table : « Check » : la valeur ou l’état vérifié ne correspond pas à l’attente.</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
    </table:table-row>
    <table:table-row>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="Table22.A1" office:value-type="string">
      <text:p text:style-name="Table_20_Contents">2762</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="Table22.A1" office:value-type="string">
      <text:p text:style-name="Table_20_Contents">Interstys</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="Table22.A1" office:value-type="string">
      <text:p text:style-name="Table_20_Contents">Table : trop de noms.</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
    </table:table-row>
    <text:soft-page-break/>
    <table:table-row>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="Table22.A1" office:value-type="string">
      <text:p text:style-name="Table_20_Contents">2763</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="Table22.A1" office:value-type="string">
      <text:p text:style-name="Table_20_Contents">Interstys</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="Table22.A1" office:value-type="string">
      <text:p text:style-name="Table_20_Contents">Table : l’enregistreur désigne une ligne non définie.</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
    </table:table-row>
    <table:table-row>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="Table22.A1" office:value-type="string">
      <text:p text:style-name="Table_20_Contents">2764</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="Table22.A1" office:value-type="string">
      <text:p text:style-name="Table_20_Contents">Interstys</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="Table22.A1" office:value-type="string">
      <text:p text:style-name="Table_20_Contents">Table : canaux de l’enregistreur incompatibles avec la ligne.</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
    </table:table-row>
    <table:table-row>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="Table22.A1" office:value-type="string">
      <text:p text:style-name="Table_20_Contents">2765</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="Table22.A1" office:value-type="string">
      <text:p text:style-name="Table_20_Contents">Interstys</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="Table22.A1" office:value-type="string">
      <text:p text:style-name="Table_20_Contents">Table : retard du lecteur plus long que la ligne.</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
    </table:table-row>
    <table:table-row>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="Table22.A1" office:value-type="string">
      <text:p text:style-name="Table_20_Contents">2766</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="Table22.A1" office:value-type="string">
      <text:p text:style-name="Table_20_Contents">Interstys</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="Table22.A1" office:value-type="string">
      <text:p text:style-name="Table_20_Contents">Table : mémoire insuffisante pour cet élément.</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
    </table:table-row>
    <table:table-row>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="Table22.A1" office:value-type="string">
      <text:p text:style-name="Table_20_Contents">2767</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="Table22.A1" office:value-type="string">
      <text:p text:style-name="Table_20_Contents">Interstys</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="Table22.A1" office:value-type="string">
      <text:p text:style-name="Table_20_Contents">Table : cette clé n’a pas de sens pour ce type d’effet.</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
    </table:table-row>
    <table:table-row>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="Table22.A1" office:value-type="string">
      <text:p text:style-name="Table_20_Contents">2768</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="Table22.A1" office:value-type="string">
      <text:p text:style-name="Table_20_Contents">Interstys</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="Table22.A1" office:value-type="string">
      <text:p text:style-name="Table_20_Contents">Table : la sortie de l’effet est aussi sa source.</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
    </table:table-row>
    <table:table-row>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="Table22.A1" office:value-type="string">
      <text:p text:style-name="Table_20_Contents">2769</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="Table22.A1" office:value-type="string">
      <text:p text:style-name="Table_20_Contents">Interstys</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="Table22.A1" office:value-type="string">
      <text:p text:style-name="Table_20_Contents">Table : fichier : le dossier du projet est inconnu (script auxiliaire).</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
    </table:table-row>
    <table:table-row>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="Table22.A1" office:value-type="string">
      <text:p text:style-name="Table_20_Contents">2770</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="Table22.A1" office:value-type="string">
      <text:p text:style-name="Table_20_Contents">Interstys</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="Table22.A1" office:value-type="string">
      <text:p text:style-name="Table_20_Contents">Table : le fichier ne peut pas être ouvert.</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
    </table:table-row>
    <table:table-row>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="Table22.A1" office:value-type="string">
      <text:p text:style-name="Table_20_Contents">2771</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="Table22.A1" office:value-type="string">
      <text:p text:style-name="Table_20_Contents">Interstys</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="Table22.A1" office:value-type="string">
      <text:p text:style-name="Table_20_Contents">Fichier son : le fichier ne peut pas être ouvert.</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
    </table:table-row>
    <table:table-row>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="Table22.A1" office:value-type="string">
      <text:p text:style-name="Table_20_Contents">2772</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="Table22.A1" office:value-type="string">
      <text:p text:style-name="Table_20_Contents">Interstys</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="Table22.A1" office:value-type="string">
      <text:p text:style-name="Table_20_Contents">Fichier son : nombre de canaux (1 à 128) ou fréquence (2 400 à 384 000 Hz) hors limites.</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
    </table:table-row>
    <table:table-row>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="Table22.A1" office:value-type="string">
      <text:p text:style-name="Table_20_Contents">2773</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="Table22.A1" office:value-type="string">
      <text:p text:style-name="Table_20_Contents">Interstys</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="Table22.A1" office:value-type="string">
      <text:p text:style-name="Table_20_Contents">Fichier son : lecture incomplète.</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
    </table:table-row>
    <table:table-row>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="Table22.A1" office:value-type="string">
      <text:p text:style-name="Table_20_Contents">2774</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="Table22.A1" office:value-type="string">
      <text:p text:style-name="Table_20_Contents">Interstys</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="Table22.A1" office:value-type="string">
      <text:p text:style-name="Table_20_Contents">Table : lecteur en mode « Delay » : il suit un enregistreur (clé « writer »), pas une ligne.</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
    </table:table-row>
    <table:table-row>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="Table22.A1" office:value-type="string">
      <text:p text:style-name="Table_20_Contents">2775</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="Table22.A1" office:value-type="string">
      <text:p text:style-name="Table_20_Contents">Interstys</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="Table22.A1" office:value-type="string">
      <text:p text:style-name="Table_20_Contents">Table : le lecteur suit un enregistreur qui n’écrit pas dans sa ligne.</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
    </table:table-row>
    <table:table-row>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="Table22.A1" office:value-type="string">
      <text:p text:style-name="Table_20_Contents">2776</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="Table22.A1" office:value-type="string">
      <text:p text:style-name="Table_20_Contents">Interstys</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="Table22.A1" office:value-type="string">
      <text:p text:style-name="Table_20_Contents">Table : « Display » : Effect, Reader, Writer, Line, Curve, Instance ou le nom d’un module attendu.</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
    </table:table-row>
    <table:table-row>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="Table22.A1" office:value-type="string">
      <text:p text:style-name="Table_20_Contents">2777</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="Table22.A1" office:value-type="string">
      <text:p text:style-name="Table_20_Contents">Interstys</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="Table22.A1" office:value-type="string">
      <text:p text:style-name="Table_20_Contents">Table : « Display » : aucun module de ce nom.</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
    </table:table-row>
    <table:table-row>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="Table22.A1" office:value-type="string">
      <text:p text:style-name="Table_20_Contents">2781</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="Table22.A1" office:value-type="string">
      <text:p text:style-name="Table_20_Contents">Interstys</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="Table22.A1" office:value-type="string">
      <text:p text:style-name="Table_20_Contents">Table : « Instance » : algorithme inconnu.</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
    </table:table-row>
    <table:table-row>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="Table22.A1" office:value-type="string">
      <text:p text:style-name="Table_20_Contents">2782</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="Table22.A1" office:value-type="string">
      <text:p text:style-name="Table_20_Contents">Interstys</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="Table22.A1" office:value-type="string">
      <text:p text:style-name="Table_20_Contents">Table : « Algorithm » : un nom est attendu.</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
    </table:table-row>
    <table:table-row>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="Table22.A1" office:value-type="string">
      <text:p text:style-name="Table_20_Contents">2783</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="Table22.A1" office:value-type="string">
      <text:p text:style-name="Table_20_Contents">Interstys</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="Table22.A1" office:value-type="string">
      <text:p text:style-name="Table_20_Contents">Table : « Instance » : un nom est attendu.</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
    </table:table-row>
    <table:table-row>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="Table22.A1" office:value-type="string">
      <text:p text:style-name="Table_20_Contents">2784</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="Table22.A1" office:value-type="string">
      <text:p text:style-name="Table_20_Contents">Interstys</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="Table22.A1" office:value-type="string">
      <text:p text:style-name="Table_20_Contents">Table : « Instance » : argument incorrect pour cet algorithme.</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
    </table:table-row>
    <table:table-row>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="Table22.A1" office:value-type="string">
      <text:p text:style-name="Table_20_Contents">2785</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="Table22.A1" office:value-type="string">
      <text:p text:style-name="Table_20_Contents">Interstys</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="Table22.A1" office:value-type="string">
      <text:p text:style-name="Table_20_Contents">Table : « Instance » : valeur d’argument hors des bornes déclarées par l’algorithme.</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
    </table:table-row>
    <table:table-row>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="Table22.A1" office:value-type="string">
      <text:p text:style-name="Table_20_Contents">2786</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="Table22.A1" office:value-type="string">
      <text:p text:style-name="Table_20_Contents">Interstys</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="Table22.A1" office:value-type="string">
      <text:p text:style-name="Table_20_Contents">Table : « Instance » : argument obligatoire manquant.</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
    </table:table-row>
    <table:table-row>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="Table22.A1" office:value-type="string">
      <text:p text:style-name="Table_20_Contents">2787</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="Table22.A1" office:value-type="string">
      <text:p text:style-name="Table_20_Contents">Interstys</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="Table22.A1" office:value-type="string">
      <text:p text:style-name="Table_20_Contents">Table : « Set » : instance inconnue.</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
    </table:table-row>
    <table:table-row>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="Table22.A1" office:value-type="string">
      <text:p text:style-name="Table_20_Contents">2788</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="Table22.A1" office:value-type="string">
      <text:p text:style-name="Table_20_Contents">Interstys</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="Table22.A1" office:value-type="string">
      <text:p text:style-name="Table_20_Contents">Table : trop d’arguments, de « Set » ou de modèles dans cette table.</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
    </table:table-row>
    <table:table-row>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="Table22.A1" office:value-type="string">
      <text:p text:style-name="Table_20_Contents">2790</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="Table22.A1" office:value-type="string">
      <text:p text:style-name="Table_20_Contents">Interstys</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="Table22.A1" office:value-type="string">
      <text:p text:style-name="Table_20_Contents">Table : mémoire insuffisante (arguments, algorithme ou table développée).</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
    </table:table-row>
    <table:table-row>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="Table22.A1" office:value-type="string">
